This licence covers the original code, notebooks, written documentation and
the Python-generated figures in this repository.

It does NOT re-license the underlying datasets or third-party works, which
keep their own terms:

  * Palmer Penguins data (experiment-3) - CC0 1.0 public-domain dedication,
    Gorman, Williams & Fraser (2014), PLoS ONE 9(3): e109091.
  * Iris flower measurements (experiment-1) - Fisher's classic dataset as
    distributed by the UCI Machine Learning Repository; see the UCI record
    for the current terms.
  * Papers referenced in experiment-2 - titles, authors and links only; no
    publisher figures, text or data are redistributed. The redesigned figures
